  "version": "0.6.8",
  "notes": "Shared file attachments: the composer + button now opens the device file picker instead of creating a new chat. Selected files appear as removable attachment chips and upload to the central XemAi host so phone and desktop share them. Up to 3 files per message are supported at 5 MB each. Text/code/log/config and similar text formats are supplied to the local model with a bounded attachment context; binary files are stored and shown without pretending the current text-only model can inspect their contents.",
